# Direct dependencies. What gets installed is requirements.txt, the exact,
# hash-checked set compiled from this file : edit a line here, then regenerate
# it (the command is at the top of requirements.txt). Dependabot does the same
# every week and proposes the result as a pull request.
#
# Django follows the current LTS line (5.2, supported until April 2028). The
# next one is 6.2 : moving to it is a deliberate upgrade, not a side effect of
# an install.
